title: Events
act: Arrival
scenario: The dark lamp
when: once
when: $act == Act.Arrival
---
The causeway to Brinemoor is open at low tide. You cross it with the post bag on your back.
The lighthouse stands dark over the town.
===

title: Brandt
act: Arrival
scenario: The dark lamp
when: $quest_lamp == QuestState.Active and not has_item("key")
---
Brandt: The keeper is gone, and the lamp with her. Odile left me the spare key.
-> I will light the lamp. Give me the key.
    Brandt: Take it. Bring it back.
    <<give key>>
-> It is not my lamp.
    Brandt: It will be everyone's, tonight.
===

title: Brandt
act: Arrival
when: always
---
Brandt: Harbour office. Mind the tide.
===

title: Maud
act: Arrival
scenario: The dark lamp
when: $quest_lamp == QuestState.Active and not $oil_allowed
---
Maud: A lamp needs oil. Take a can from my shed, by the pier.
<<set $oil_allowed = true>>
===

title: Maud
act: Arrival
when: always
---
Maud: The fish don't wait, courier.
===

title: OilCan
act: Arrival
quest: lamp
when: $oil_allowed and not $oil_taken
---
You take a can of lamp oil.
<<give oil>>
<<set $oil_taken = true>>
===

title: LighthouseDoor
act: Arrival
quest: lamp
when: $quest_lamp == QuestState.NotStarted
---
You knock. Nobody answers. High above, the lamp room is dark.
<<set $quest_lamp = QuestState.Active>>
<<quest_changed lamp>>
===

title: LighthouseDoor
act: Arrival
quest: lamp
when: $quest_lamp == QuestState.Active and $lamp_can_be_lit
---
The key turns. You climb, fill the lamp and light it.
<<take oil>>
<<set $lamp_lit = true>>
<<set $quest_lamp = QuestState.Succeeded>>
<<quest_changed lamp>>
===

title: Events
act: Arrival
scenario: The dark lamp
when: $is_night
when: $quest_lamp == QuestState.Active
---
Night falls on a dark lamp.
<<set $quest_lamp = QuestState.Failed>>
<<quest_changed lamp>>
===

title: PierChatter
act: Arrival
when: always
---
Maud: Dues up again, they say.
Joss: Let them say it to my face.
===
